        <activityName xml:lang="en">Production plant, natural gas</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Production plant, natural gas
Life time is 60 years. Annual production is 1.54 E12 MJ gas per year which is equal to 4.23 E10 Nm3 per year.;
UUID: 5aea06d6-4382-30a9-bd49-92ee844bd5a7
Material, land and energy requirements of a natural gas production plant.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data on buildings is based on German data. Land use is based on data for Kollsnes and Karsto, the gas treatment plants in Norway.
Time period: Data for building requirements stems from 1989 data. 
Production volume: Karsto and Kollsnes: 1.3e12 MJ
Sampling: no information about sampling procedure. 
Extrapolations: Data is extrapolated from Norwegian and German data.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5aea06d6-4382-30a9-bd49-92ee844bd5a7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
